格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Connect Overleaf projects to DeepSeek Harness (DSH) through OverleafMCP and MCP tools.","id":"gh:1333998031","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-overleaf","slug":"fly233338/dsh-overleaf","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","latex","mcp","overleaf","overleaf-mcp"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Connect Overleaf projects to DeepSeek Harness (DSH) through OverleafMCP and MCP tools."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-overleaf"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Connect multiple Overleaf projects to DeepSeek Harness (DSH) through @fly233338/overleaf-mcp."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-overleaf` installs @fly233338/overleaf-mcp as an npm dependency, starts it through MCP stdio, a"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nd exposes its tools to DSH. The OverleafMCP source is not copied into this project."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Browse and read files from multiple Overleaf projects, inspect document sections and section content"},{"id":"p7s2","text":", write files or sections back to Overleaf through Git, and use the DSH MCP Client provided by the h"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ost. **Based on my experience, it is especially useful in the following scenarios: understanding an "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"entire LaTeX project, automatically fixing LaTeX compilation errors, and unifying terminology and sy"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"mbols throughout the document.**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- DSH `0.1.0-rc.5` or `0.2.x` (verified against `0.2.0-rc.2`).\n- Node.js `22.19.0` or newer.\n- An Ov"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"erleaf Git integration token."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"If the DSH CLI is installed and available on `PATH`:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"From a DSH source checkout:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The npm installation command becomes available after this package is published."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The plugin stores `dsh-overleaf.config.json` under `$DSH_HOME/dsh-overleaf/`. If `DSH_HOME` is not s"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"et, it uses `~/.dsh/dsh-overleaf/`. The directory and file are created on startup when missing. Fill"},{"id":"p17s3","text":" in one shared token and one project ID per line:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Get project IDs from the `<id>` in the Overleaf project URL. Create the Git token under Overleaf Acc"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ount Settings → Git Integration."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Restart DSH after editing the file. The plugin reads it once at startup and generates the internal `"},{"id":"p20s2","text":".dsh-overleaf.projects.json` OverleafMCP project configuration in the same directory. Do not edit th"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"jects.json` OverleafMCP project configuration in the same directory. Do not edit the generated file."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The plugin does not read `.env` and does not require Overleaf environment variables."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Use with the model"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Tell the model which project to handle:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The model first calls `mcp__overleaf__list_projects`, then passes the selected ID as `projectName` t"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"o subsequent Overleaf tools. Write operations require an explicit `commitMessage` and push a Git com"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"rleaf tools. Write operations require an explicit `commitMessage` and push a Git commit to Overleaf."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Keep the token out of public source repositories and published package contents."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Scope"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The current version supports multiple Overleaf projects through one MCP tool group. It does not comp"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ile documents, review PDFs, or automate a browser."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Project repository\n- @fly233338/overleaf-mcp (npm)\n- DSH plugin guide\n- insert:\n- id: dsh-overleaf"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"y\n- @fly233338/overleaf-mcp (npm)\n- DSH plugin guide\n- insert:\n- id: dsh-overleaf\nname: dsh-overleaf"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
